# Added by us. Not part of upstream Open-LLM-VTuber.
#
# Why this file has to live here (depth matters)
# ----------------------------------------------
# The root .gitignore excludes these two models:
#
#     Open-LLM-VTuber/live2d-models/mao_pro/
#     Open-LLM-VTuber/live2d-models/shizuku/
#
# but the rules had no effect, because the vendored .gitignore one level up
# re-includes them:
#
#     /live2d-models/*
#     !/live2d-models/mao_pro      <-- negation
#     !/live2d-models/shizuku      <-- negation
#
# A .gitignore deeper in the tree takes precedence over one further up, so the
# negation wins no matter what the root file says. The result was silent: no
# error, no warning, 37 model files tracked and pushed. `git check-ignore`
# hides it too -- by default it skips already-tracked files, so you have to ask
# with `--no-index` to see the truth.
#
# The only way to win is to answer from a deeper directory than the one holding
# the negation, which is exactly what this file does. Adding it is preferable
# to editing upstream's file: this is additive, reviewable, and survives an
# upstream sync.
#
# License note: these two are Live2D's official free sample models, distributed
# upstream under the "Free Material License Agreement". We still keep them out
# because the release boundary is "our own source only" -- see ASSETS.md for
# how to obtain a character model.
mao_pro/
shizuku/
